Subject: build: the Baton version label, Baton's shared exports and workspace pins

Version 0.0.45-baton.N on the released packages; packages/shared exports for its baton* modules;
the pnpm-workspace node-pty override (backported from upstream 22840ab943); desktop external
packages and licence notices for the voice runtime; .gitignore for .baton/inbox. pnpm-lock.yaml
is regenerated on every sync, never patched (see REGENERATED).

